    "procedure_checklist": {
      "chambers_communications": "Email assistant with case number/name/matter; file substantive requests with clerk and serve others; no ex parte discussion.",
      "hearing_scheduling": "Request dates from assistant, coordinate without copying assistant into scheduling exchanges, then obtain confirmation; dates are not held. Email notice after confirmation.",
      "conferral": "Published guide conditions discovery hearing dates on personal conferral and certificate; detailed motion-specific litigation not abstracted.",
      "proposed_orders": "Attorneys: email Word orders/final judgments with enclosure letter and motion copy after e-filing supporting motion; guide says proposed orders are not accepted via clerk e-filing. Ordinarily submit within30days after hearing unless directed otherwise. Non-electronic-service parties require service envelopes; self-represented parties lacking e-service may submit paper.",
      "courtesy_copies": "Mail or hand-deliver memorandum/case-law binders at least5business days before hearing; guide separately refuses attorney paper motion/order filings. Preserve the separate scopes.",
      "remote_appearances": "Use assistant-provided Zoom link for authorized hearing; specific hearing order governs conflicting general instructions. Status/non-evidentiary Zoom requests require written motion/order and approval confirmed with assistant at least10days before hearing. No blanket remote permission.",
      "routing": "Guide directs foreclosure inquiries to foreclosure case manager, not judge office; guardianship matters assigned to magistrate go there. Detailed specialized manuals not followed."
    },
    "review_scope": "Reused original October19 profile/HTML guide. Read Levy-specific recurring contact/scheduling/submission/remote and routing sections. Profile current family/probate and prior civil assignments distinguished from guide heading Levy Circuit Civil and Family Court. Detailed merits, exhibits, trial/forms and special family requirements not abstracted.",
    "summary": "Levy office receives all mail/deliveries. Teresa Stephenson is assistant. Levy-labeled operating guide retained with current/prior assignment discrepancy and submission-channel exceptions.",
